Refactor across files: our Flask app checks auth inline in every handler. Move it into middleware and update every call site.

```python
# handlers/users.py
@app.route('/users/<int:uid>')
def get_user(uid):
    token = request.headers.get('Authorization')
    if not token or not verify(token):
        abort(401)
    return jsonify(load_user(uid))

# handlers/orders.py
@app.route('/orders')
def list_orders():
    token = request.headers.get('Authorization')
    if not token or not verify(token):
        abort(401)
    return jsonify(load_orders(current_user()))
```

